de.</p></header><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm \"><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#5B2A86]\">31</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">aggregated demand signals</p></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">DEMAND</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm \"><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#2F7D5C]\">3 verified</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">verified suppliers</p></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">SUPPLY — <!-- -->15<!-- --> required</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm \"><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#C2453B]\">12</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">gap</p></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">GAP</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm \"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">Work</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#241A33]\">3</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">total</p></div><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#2F7D5C]\">1</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">completed</p></div><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#B2600E]\">2</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">active</p></div><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#C2453B]\">0</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">blocked</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-3 space-y-1\"><a class=\"block rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-xs text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-801\">→ <!-- -->Aggregate Klerksdorp repair demand</a><a class=\"block rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-xs text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-802\">→ <!-- -->Cross-town supply pilot design (Klerksdorp↔Senekal)</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm \"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">Proof</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#2F7D5C]\">1</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">verified</p></div><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#B2600E]\">1</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">pending</p></div><div><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#C2453B]\">1</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">missing</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-3 space-y-1\"><a class=\"block rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-xs text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/proof/syn-proof-810\">→ <!-- -->Demand register export</a></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm mt-4 border-[#D9C7EA] bg-[#F7F1FB]\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#5B2A86]\">Intelligence</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-semibold leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Cross-town signals suggest a Klerksdorp↔Senekal pilot (scenario G).</p><div class=\"mt-3\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-801</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-802</a></span></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm \"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#B2600E]\">Why</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Because demand here and verified supply there have never been connected.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm \"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#B2600E]\">Next</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Recommendation: test a bounded cross-town supply pilot with Senekal builders.</p><p class=\"mt-3 rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#8A5410]\">PROPOSED — PENDING HUMAN APPROVAL<!-- --> · nothing executes without you</p></div></div><section class=\"mt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">People carrying this initiative</h2><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/person/syn-person-kagiso\">Kagiso Molefe<!-- --> · <!-- -->Trader</a></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">Statements — evidence-linked</h2><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-5 border-[#EADFD2] bg-white shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Cross-town signals suggest a pilot: 31 Klerksdorp demand signals meet verified Senekal supply.</p><span class=\"shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-[#9DC9B4] text-[#2F7D5C]\">Evidence-linked</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#5B2A86]\">Capability:</span> <!-- -->Untested opportunity — evidence supports a bounded test, not a rollout.</p><div class=\"mt-2\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-801</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-802</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-202\">syn-work-202</a></span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Next:</span> <!-- -->Propose the Klerksdorp↔Senekal cross-town pilot<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Owner:</span> <!-- -->Kagiso Molefe<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Review:</span> <!-- -->pilot decision point</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-[#D9C7EA] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F7F1FB] to-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#5B2A86]\">CHIEF OF STAFF</h2><p class=\"text-xs italic text-[#8B7FA3]\">Market Link — Klerksdorp · five modes</p></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Chief of Staff modes\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#5B2A86] bg-[#5B2A86] text-white\">OBSERVE</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#D9C7EA] bg-white text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\">EXPLAIN</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#D9C7EA] bg-white text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\">CHALLENGE</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#D9C7EA] bg-white text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\">COACH</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#D9C7EA] bg-white text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\">ACT</button></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs italic text-[#8B7FA3]\">What is happening?</p><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-3\"><p class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Cross-town signals suggest a pilot: 31 Klerksdorp demand signals meet verified Senekal supply.</p></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-12\"><footer class=\"mt-16 border-t border-[#EADFD2] pt-6 text-xs text-[#8B7FA3]\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-[#5A4E6D]\">UBUNTU TOWN OS · Experience 001</p><p class=\"mt-1 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed\">Build the person. Build the initiative. Build the town. Every claim links to evidence; where evidence is missing the system says so. Consequential actions are proposals only — they require human approval and are simulated in this demo. Synthetic demo data. 50 Blueprint towns · 9 provinces navigation model.</p></footer></div></div><!--$--><!--$?--><template id=\"B:0\"></template><!--/$--><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\" data-react-aria-top-layer=\"true\"></section><!--/$--><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2c226e022979f4f0.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><style>\n#nprogress {\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n#nprogress .bar {\n  background: #6B1F66;\n\n  position: fixed;\n  z-index: 99999;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 4px;\n}\n\n/* Fancy blur effect */\n#nprogress .peg {\n  display: block;\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 0px;\n  width: 100px;\n  height: 100%;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px #6B1F66, 0 0 5px #6B1F66;\n  opacity: 1.0;\n\n  -webkit-transform: r